@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}


<section class="banner">    
    <h1>About Us</h1>
</section>
<div class="gsinfo">
    <div class="infotext">
        <h1>Our Story</h1>
        <h3>
            Welcome to DpMart, your one-stop destination for all your grocery needs! At FreshMart, we believe in providing our customers with the highest quality products, sourced from the finest producers locally and globally. Our extensive selection ranges from fresh produce, organic options, and dairy products to pantry essentials, gourmet treats, and household supplies. We are committed to sustainability and offer a variety of eco-friendly and ethically sourced items. With our user-friendly online shopping platform, you can easily browse, select, and have your groceries delivered right to your doorstep, ensuring convenience and saving you valuable time. Whether you're preparing a family meal, stocking up your pantry, or discovering new flavors, FreshMart is here to make your shopping experience delightful and hassle-free. Join our community today and experience the joy of fresh, quality groceries with every visit. Welcome to FreshMart, where freshness meets convenience!
        </h3>
        <div class="endline"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="infoimg">
        <img src="~/images/about1.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
</div>
